osition finds axes with max variance; 4) Retain top eigenvalues. Math isn’t scary if you break it down—eigenvectors are vectors, and eigenvalues measure variance. Trust the process!", "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize explanations (adapting to student pace) or generate interactive problems. For example, they’d explain proofs step-by-step if students struggle. My low extraversion suggests I prefer detailed guides over group discussions—so clear, bite-sized answers would help learners like me avoid burnout."
